<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Complete in Thee—no more shall sin,</l><l>Thy grace hath conquered, reign within;</l><l>Thy voice shall bid the tempter flee,</l><l>And I shall stand complete in Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Complete in Thee—each want supplied,</l><l>And no good thing to me denied;</l><l>Since Thou my portion, Lord, wilt be,</l><l>I ask no more, complete in Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Dear Savior! when before Thy bar</l><l>All tribes and tongues assembled are,</l><l>Among Thy chosen will I be,</l><l>At Thy right hand—complete in Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
